      <h2 class="section__title">Pet Clothing Size Guide | Dog, Cat & Equestrian Pattern Blocks</h2>
    </div>
    
    <p class="text-content">SDF holds dedicated pattern blocks for dogs, cats, and horses | none of our sizing is scaled down from human clothing. Each species has its own proportions and movement needs, and our blocks are built from those measurements directly. Custom size blocks for specific breeds are available on request.</p>
    
    <h3 class="section__subtitle" style="margin-top: 2.5rem;">Dog Clothing Sizing | XXS to 5XL</h3>
    
    <div class="table-wrap" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
