    <h3 class="section__subtitle" style="margin-top: 3rem;">Cat Clothing Sizing | XS to L</h3>
    
    <p class="text-content">Cats need a different pattern logic than dogs | most domestic cats fall into a much narrower size range, but the chest girth to body length ratio varies more between breeds (a Maine Coon and a domestic shorthair at similar weight have very different proportions). We grade cat patterns with extra ease at the shoulders since cats arch and twist more than dogs during normal movement.</p>
    
