    <p class="text-content" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">Cat garments need looser shoulder and front-leg openings than the equivalent dog size | a cat that can't fully extend its front legs will usually refuse to wear the garment at all, which shows up as returns rather than complaints.</p>
    
    <h3 class="section__subtitle" style="margin-top: 3rem;">Horse Rug & Equestrian Sizing | By Height (hh)</h3>
    
    <p class="text-content">Equestrian rugs size by height at the withers, measured in hands (hh), not weight or breed. Rug length is the critical second measurement | too short leaves the hindquarters exposed, too long rubs at the shoulders during movement.</p>
    
